      "created_at": "2015-02-03T23:18:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Beefcake and Caliginous form should stack. &nbsp;(we won't find out for sure until a ruling is passed down)</p><p>If they do Guise can really rock the Sentinel's setup.</p><p>Also consider Sentinel Tactics.</p><blockquote><p>The first time one of Guise deal damage each turn you may use a power.</p></blockquote><p>Uh, yes please.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For Clarity:</p><p>The Sentinels</p><p>Idealist</p><p>Writhe</p><p>Mainstay</p><p>Dr. Medico</p><p>These are all names of heroes, all would changed to Guise.</p>",
