      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-02-04T00:32:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Nope!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Hippocratic Oath\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Hippocratic Oath:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Whenever Dr. Medico would deal Damage, prevent that Damage and instead 1 Hero Target regains that much HP.</p>\n<p>At the end of your turn, if Dr. Medico is active, up to 3 Targets regain 1 HP each.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The real question is what would happen if you stole Jack Handle, and then copied say… Tempest's base power?</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:05:29.121Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
