      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Nope!\n\n&nbsp;\n\n[quote=\"Hippocratic Oath\"]\n Whenever Dr. Medico would deal Damage, prevent that Damage and instead 1 Hero Target regains that much HP. \n\n At the end of your turn, if Dr. Medico is active, up to 3 Targets regain 1 HP each.\n[/quote]\n \n\n&nbsp;\n\n The real question is what would happen if you stole Jack Handle, and then copied say... Tempest&#39;s base power? \n",
